  <jpcrp_cor:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesIncludedInGeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesAndManufacturingCostForCurrentPeriodTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;※１　一般管理費及び当期製造費用に含まれる研究開発費は次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
